0.22 XMR
9 reviews
escrow ✓

seller B
0.17 XMR
0 reviews
direct only

seller C
0.31 XMR
42 reviews
escrow ✓
```

Then `qp`, not the LLM, evaluates:

```text
legal category                     ✓
budget                             ✓
seller reputation                  ✓
escrow available                   ✓
listing unchanged                  ✓
price unchanged                    ✓
required delivery conditions       ✓
```

and generates:

```text
PURCHASE_PROPOSAL
```

The model still cannot spend anything.

Your grant might be:

```yaml
