constraints:
  listing: xyEr
  max_atomic_xmr: 400000000000
  escrow_required: true
  max_shipping: 0
  physical_goods: false
  expiry: 2026-09-14T00:00:00Z

gates:
  - seller_trust >= threshold
  - listing_hash == approved_hash
  - legality == PASS
```

Only then can the wallet capability participate.

The worker returns the code.

`qp` runs:

```text
pytest
cargo test
cargo clippy
security policy
```

If:

$$
V(artifact) \geq threshold
$$

then:

```text
RELEASE_ESCROW
```

Otherwise:

```text
REQUEST_REVISION
```

or eventually:

```text
DISPUTE
```

That is an actual autonomous business transaction.

